# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: Julius.
Package: Julius
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Apps.Games.!Julius (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-julius
Description: Open-source engine for Caesar III, the Roman city-building game
 Plays the original Caesar III and its saved games in a desktop window
 or full screen, with wide-screen support. It needs the files from your
 own copy of Caesar III (1.0.1.0: GOG, Steam or CD). Pi 4 recommended.
